          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "chris.kleckner@stryker.com",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">Our solutions go beyond data – it’s a true partnership</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our ProClinical outcome based solutions help you set goals and implement an action plan to get the most from state-of-the-art products, optimize processes and be positioned for long-term success.</span></p>\n",
